    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## 📊 Visão Executiva\n\nResumo de inventário e consumo de recursos Azure no período selecionado.\n\n> ℹ️ **Fontes**: Azure Resource Graph (inventário) + Azure Monitor Metrics (telemetria).",
              "style": "text"
            },
            "name": "text-exec-header"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "Resources\n| where array_length({ResourceGroup}) == 0 or 'value::all' in ({ResourceGroup}) or resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| where type in~ ('microsoft.compute/virtualmachines','microsoft.web/sites','microsoft.storage/storageaccounts','microsoft.sql/servers/databases','microsoft.dbforpostgresql/flexibleservers/databases','microsoft.dbformysql/flexibleservers/databases')\n| extend Tipo = case(\n    type =~ 'microsoft.compute/virtualmachines', 'Virtual Machines',\n    type =~ 'microsoft.web/sites', 'App Services',\n    type =~ 'microsoft.storage/storageaccounts', 'Storage Accounts',\n    type =~ 'microsoft.sql/servers/databases', 'Azure SQL Databases',\n    type =~ 'microsoft.dbforpostgresql/flexibleservers/databases', 'PostgreSQL Flexible Server DBs',\n    type =~ 'microsoft.dbformysql/flexibleservers/databases', 'MySQL Flexible Server DBs',\n    'Outros'\n)\n| summarize Quantidade = count() by Tipo\n| order by Quantidade desc",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "Inventário de Recursos por Tipo",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Quantidade",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "blue"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "name": "query-exec-inv"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "Resources\n| where array_length({ResourceGroup}) == 0 or 'value::all' in ({ResourceGroup}) or resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| where type in~ ('microsoft.compute/virtualmachines','microsoft.web/sites','microsoft.storage/storageaccounts','microsoft.sql/servers/databases','microsoft.dbforpostgresql/flexibleservers/databases','microsoft.dbformysql/flexibleservers/databases')\n| summarize Quantidade = count() by location\n| where isnotempty(location)\n| project latitude = location, longitude = location, title = location, size = Quantidade",
              "size": 3,
              "title": "Distribuição por Região",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "map"
            },
            "name": "query-exec-region"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "Resources\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.compute/virtualmachines'\n| where array_length({ResourceGroup}) == 0 or 'value::all' in ({ResourceGroup}) or resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| summarize Quantidade = count() by Tamanho = tostring(properties.hardwareProfile.vmSize)\n| order by Quantidade desc",
              "size": 3,
              "title": "VMs — Inventário por Tamanho",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "piechart"
            },
            "name": "query-exec-vm-sizes"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "Resources\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.web/serverfarms'\n| where array_length({ResourceGroup}) == 0 or 'value::all' in ({ResourceGroup}) or resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| summarize Quantidade = count() by SKU = tostring(sku.name), Tier = tostring(sku.tier)\n| order by Quantidade desc",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "App Service Plans — SKU e Tier",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table"
            },
            "name": "query-exec-asp-sku"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Limitações Conhecidas\n\n| Recurso | Fonte | Observação |\n|---------|-------|------------|\n| CPU, Disco, Rede (VMs) | Azure Monitor Metrics | Métricas de host, sem agente adicional |\n| Memória (VMs) | Azure Monitor Agent + DCR | Requer configuração adicional |\n| App Service CPU/Memória % | Azure Monitor Metrics | Disponível no nível do App Service Plan |",
              "style": "text"
            },
            "name": "text-exec-notes"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "tab-executivo",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "Executivo"
      }
    },
