          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## 💻 Máquinas Virtuais\n\nMétricas nativas de CPU, disco e rede. Use o seletor **Máquinas Virtuais** para filtrar recursos específicos.\n\n> ⚠️ **Memória**: Requer Azure Monitor Agent (AMA) + Data Collection Rule (DCR).",
              "style": "text"
            },
            "name": "text-vms-header"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "Resources\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.compute/virtualmachines'\n| where array_length({ResourceGroup}) == 0 or 'value::all' in ({ResourceGroup}) or resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| project Nome = name, ['Grupo de Recursos'] = resourceGroup, Região = location, Tamanho = tostring(properties.hardwareProfile.vmSize), SO = tostring(properties.storageProfile.osDisk.osType), Estado = tostring(properties.provisioningState)\n| order by Nome asc",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "Lista de Máquinas Virtuais",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table"
            },
            "name": "query-vms-list"
